# Homepage — frontend

- Prefer **HTML 3.2-era markup**: tables, `body`/`font`/`bgcolor` attributes, default browser styling. Avoid external CSS and modern layout systems unless Frank asks.
- Project rows come from `projects.json` — prefer editing that file over hard-coding rows in HTML.
- Escape content strings when rendering into the DOM (`app.js` helpers). Staging/production links: `target="_blank"` + `rel="noopener noreferrer"`.
- Keep structure clean and readable (clear heading, one projects table, short imprint) — authentic bare-bones, not a parody dump.
- Bump `?v=` on `js/app.js` when shipping script changes.
